---
import MarketingLayout from "../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, COMPANY_NAME } from "../lib/urls";
---
<MarketingLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Vyfoo's privacy policy covering how VYQDA Technologies collects, uses, and protects information submitted through this website."
  path="/privacy"
  noindex={false}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy Policy</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>This page describes how {COMPANY_NAME} handles information submitted through this website. This is a placeholder structure — replace with counsel-reviewed legal copy before relying on it as a binding policy.</p>
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>Information you submit through forms on this site (such as the enterprise demo request form), including name, work email, company, and operational details you choose to share.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>To respond to your inquiry, follow up about a demo or trial, and, where you've agreed, to send relevant product updates.</p>
      <h2>Website analytics</h2>
      <p>We use Google Analytics 4 to measure site usage, such as pages viewed and which buttons are clicked. It collects pseudonymous identifiers and device and usage information, and we do not send form contents (names, emails, messages) to Google Analytics. See the <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a> for details and for how consent is handled by region.</p>
      <h2>Form submissions</h2>
      <p>When you submit a form on this site (Book Enterprise Demo, Talk to Enterprise Sales, or Contact), the details you enter, the page you submitted from, and any campaign parameters in the URL are sent to our lead-handling automation system so that our team can respond.</p>
      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <p>We don't sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>
